Package: hyprtrixie-screenshot
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ahmadlolbit <ahmadyassin714@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, libnotify-bin
Recommends: swappy
Suggests: hyprland
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Ahmadlolbit/hyprtrixie
Description: Screenshots on Hyprland, from Hyprtrixie
 hyprtrixie-screenshot takes a region, a window or the whole screen on
 Hyprland, saves it to ~/Pictures/Screenshots, copies it to the clipboard
 and shows a notification. A click on the notification opens it in swappy
 to annotate. A region also works on other wlroots desktops.
